    "en": {
      "trackName": "Voidling",
      "description": "Hatch a mysterious egg from the cosmic void and raise it through five evolutionary stages — from a tiny Voidmite to the mighty Void Sovereign.\n\nVoidling is a real-time pet simulation where your creature needs constant care. Feed it, clean it, play with it, and keep its energy up — or watch it perish in the void. Neglect it too long and it might escape entirely.\n\nFeatures:\n- Real-time gameplay that continues even when the app is closed\n- 5 evolution stages with unique creature art\n- Apple Watch companion app to check in on the go\n- Home screen and lock screen widgets\n- Notifications when your Voidling needs attention\n- Void Shards currency for instant hatching and action boosts\n- Multiple game speeds from Slow to Fast\n\nHow long can you keep yours alive?",
